    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "This is a randomized controlled study to assess the effect of choline fenofibrate compared with policosanol in Korean T2DM patients with asymptomatic atherosclerosis.",
      "detailedDescription": "In patients with type 2 diabetes with atherosclerotic combined dyslipidemia, the effect of choline fenofibrate on the progression of carotid intima media thickness and carotid artery plaque will be evaluated by 3D carotid ultrasound."
    },
